# Developer Experience

## Objective

The project should be **easy to work on**  -  build, test, configure, and debug without tribal knowledge.

## Requirements

- Clear error messages at config and build failures.
- Document setup in README or `/docs` when non-obvious.
- Scripts and commands match project conventions  -  do not invent parallel toolchains.
- Changes should not make local dev harder without reason.

